# Density Compare
# Iridium (Ir) — real density 22.56 g/cm³. equal masses: Iridium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Iridium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.1mm color: #d4d4ff at (-20mm, 3.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 179.9 g — the water cube is the reference
